            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An uplink data transmission method, a terminal, and a network side device are provided. The method includes: receiving, by a terminal, N uplink sounding pilot indices transmitted by a network side device, wherein N is a positive integer larger than 0; and transmitting, by the terminal, uplink data to the network side device in N uplink beam directions corresponding to the N uplink sounding pilot indices.</p>
